{
	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Policy - Rule - Okta Policy Rule Modified or Deleted",
	"Description": "A rule inside an Okta policy was modified or deleted. Policy rules are where the actual conditions live, so an adversary can leave the policy in place and still neutralise it by editing or removing the rule that enforces MFA.\n\nEvent types: policy.rule.update, policy.rule.delete\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/sigmahq/sigma/identity/okta/okta_policy_rule_modified_or_deleted/\n- https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/identity/okta/okta_policy_rule_modified_or_deleted.yml",
